@prefix skosdex: <https://danbri.org/ns/skosdex#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

# UK Parliament Thesaurus (Commons Library / lda.data.parliament.uk terms).
# Subject thesaurus used to index UK Parliament material. Published under the
# Open Parliament Licence v3.0 (Crown copyright; attribution, commercial use
# allowed, NO share-alike — equivalent in spirit to the Open Government Licence)
# -> licenseClass "open", bundleable.
#
# FULL CRAWL (2026-06-17): imported the COMPLETED upstream resumable crawl
# (danbri/forgetmenot `thesaurus-crawl.yml`, every 4h) — 141,822 concepts /
# 1,202,660 quads (was 1,724 at first import; 130,178 at the mid-crawl stopgap).
# Language: upstream tags every label @en; policy is default-English, mixed→English.
# A diacritic/non-ASCII scan of all labels (581 flagged at the stopgap, ~all
# accented proper nouns → stay @en) is recorded for review in `lang-review.md`
# (committed, linking each flagged term to the Parliament LD server). Genuinely
# non-English *phrases* go in LANG_OVERRIDE in tools/parliament-lda-type.mjs.
#
# The upstream Turtle carries SKOS *properties* (prefLabel/broader/narrower/
# related/exactMatch/notation) but declares no rdf:type and no ConceptScheme.
# tools/parliament-lda-type.mjs makes the SKOS typing EXPLICIT — an RDFS
# entailment of skos:prefLabel's domain (skos:Concept), not a semantic change —
# and adds the ConceptScheme + skos:inScheme links. The typed sourceFile is now
# ~35MB and regenerable, so it is gitignored; canonical.nq.gz (LFS) is the
# committed artifact. Rebuild from scratch:
#   curl -sS https://fpkg.fly.dev/kgx/parliament-lda-terms.ttl -o cache/parliament-lda-terms.ttl
#   node tools/parliament-lda-type.mjs cache/parliament-lda-terms.ttl \
#     third_party/skos/uk-parliament-thesaurus/source/parliament-lda-terms.typed.ttl
#   node scripts/skosdex normalize uk-parliament-thesaurus
#   node scripts/skosdex canonicalize uk-parliament-thesaurus
<#scheme> a skosdex:Scheme ;
    dcterms:title "UK Parliament Thesaurus (Commons Library)" ;
    dcterms:publisher <https://www.parliament.uk/> ;
    skosdex:conceptSchemeURI <http://data.parliament.uk/terms/> ;
    skosdex:sourceFile "source/parliament-lda-terms.typed.ttl" ;
    skosdex:sourceFormat "text/turtle" ;
    dcterms:license <https://www.parliament.uk/site-information/copyright-parliament/open-parliament-licence/> ;
    skosdex:licenseClass "open" ;
    skosdex:bundle true .
